<title>INDIA: India OCL gets Posco order.</title>
<headline>India OCL gets Posco order.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ceramic-maker OCL India Ltd said on Wednesday that it won a $3.0 million order from South Korean steel maker Posco, which is expanding its plant.</p>
<p>&quot;The Indian ceramics in the form of high-grade silica refractories, are expected to give a life or more than 15 years to the expanded unit,&quot; OCL said in a statement. &quot;The order will be executed in 1997/98 (April-March).&quot;</p>
<p>--New Delhi newsroom, +91-11-301 2024</p>
